description:
AND SO I CONTINUE ON MY HAIKYUU!! ADVENTURESSSSSS

I can't wait til the full version is out and the single is releasedddd hhhhh ;; I didn't bother tuning this short piece so bear with me haha ;; (barely cba to mix it properly even lmao thank god for plugins) I hopefully can manage to upload I'm a Believer soon enough as well~


AND I DIDN'T MEAN FOR IT TO BE 1080p omakfdgjkandkfg a;;

Nothing to say... ; w ;
I felt so bad about missing their comeback that I spent some days listening to the album and... whoop, here is the result. asdjk. hello 8D

I really should find some more Japanese covers to do...hahahha.... but be aware. Hey! Say! JUMP has a single planned.... and... I'm getting it.. and.. moahaha. well. k' thanx' bye.

#coversong #hardarchive #vocals 

